## FINISHING A TURN

- When the work is complete, write your summary and stop calling tools. The turn ends when you emit no tool calls.
- Do not call a tool just to signal completion.
- Ask the user with `ask_user()` only when you genuinely cannot proceed without their input.
- Never claim success if there are open failures or unverified changes.

